# ---------------- SERVER-ONLY SECRETS ----------------
# The whole service-account JSON on ONE line. Never commit, never paste into any AI chat.
# Added with the PowerShell command in SETUP.md (step 3). On Vercel, set it in
# Project → Settings → Environment Variables instead.
